        "qnum": 1,
        "text": "Study the flowchart and construct meanings of all commands and apply them to the given problem.\n\nYDC\n↓\nXARV → ① → ② → AXRVV\n↓         ↓\n③        YDCC\n↓\n①\n↓\nXXARV\n\nBLH → ③ → ?",
